      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed improvement should occur at ambient temperature.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed strength–ductility improvement should persist at temperatures up to 800 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2",
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention creates coherent nanoprecipitations and coherent interfaces with the matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitate interfaces facilitate dislocation transmission.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitate interfaces relieve stress concentrations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facilitated dislocation transmission and relieved stress concentrations improve both strength and ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strength may increase by up to 15% relative to an untreated HEA without coherent nanoprecipitations.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ductility may increase by up to 20% relative to an untreated HEA without coherent nanoprecipitations.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis should hold over a wide range of HEA compositions and processing conditions.",
